CLAUDE.md
PROGRESS.md
# docs/* rather than docs/ — git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so the negation below only works this way.
docs/*
!docs/eval-findings.md
!docs/injection-postmortem.md
*.pdf

# README.md is ignored while it is a stub.
#
# It is no longer a stub: positioning, the three headings, and the numbers are
# in and every figure in it is captured output. The only part of the original
# condition still outstanding is the asciinema at the top. Publishing is one
# line — delete this block — and that is a deliberate decision to make, not a
# thing to do by accident, because it is the first page anybody reads.
README.md
workspace/
# MEMORY.md is what one machine's agent happens to have learned — runtime
# state like runs/, not source. It also accumulates whatever a run was told
# to remember, which is exactly the content that should not be committed by
# reflex.
MEMORY.md
